Added command variants to src/main.rs Command enum (lines 93-110):

Location: After Link command, before Status command
Pattern: Follows existing command structure with clap derive macros

Code added:
```rust
/// Remove an edge between two nodes
Unlink {
    /// Source node ID
    from: i32,

    /// Target node ID
    to: i32,
},

/// Delete a node and all its connected edges
Delete {
    /// Node ID to delete
    id: i32,

    /// Show what would be deleted without actually deleting
    #[arg(long)]
    dry_run: bool,
},
```

Design decisions in this code:
- Unlink mirrors Link's from/to signature (not edge ID) for consistency
- Delete takes single node ID (matches show, status commands)
- dry_run is --dry-run flag (long only, no short) to prevent accidental use
- Doc comments become help text automatically via clap derive
